# --- art stays local until its artist says it can go in the repo -------------
# Flor's drawings are copied into assets/art/ so the prototype looks right on
# this computer, but they are NOT committed. Committing puts them in git
# history for good, and pushing to a public repo publishes them.
# When she says yes to a piece, add a line like:  !assets/art/lighthouse.jpg
assets/art/*
!assets/art/README.md

